{"body": [{"y0": 65.8, "x0": 68.5, "x1": 312.3, "text": "*Portà|r?, *vidé|r?, *pon|?, 'audi|r? infinitivus passivi est."}, {"y0": 79.1, "x0": 58.5, "x1": 161.1, "text": "Infinitivus passivi: -ri/-i."}, {"y0": 94.8, "x0": 58.8, "x1": 202.5, "text": "[1] -àri: portàri, numerari, vocari."}, {"y0": 108.8, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 150.6, "text": "160 [2] -eri: videri, teneri."}, {"y0": 122.7, "x0": 58.6, "x1": 180.3, "text": "[3] -;: poni, emi, edi, claudi."}, {"y0": 136.7, "x0": 58.6, "x1": 191.7, "text": "[4] -?ri: audiri, reperiri, aperiri."}, {"y0": 149.5, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 313.7, "text": "Piscés numeràári nón possunt. Syra rosam à Iülia teneri"}, {"y0": 164.3, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 313.0, "text": "videt. Gemmae edi non possunt. Magnum Ostium à parvà"}, {"y0": 178.5, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 230.9, "text": "165 puellà neque aperir? neque claudi potest."}, {"y0": 206.4, "x0": 57.7, "x1": 123.1, "text": "Declinátió tertia"}, {"y0": 220.1, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 312.8, "text": "*Avis! (f) et *piscis! (m) déclinantur ut *ovis'. Ut 'pàastor"}, {"y0": 233.9, "x0": 57.9, "x1": 166.1, "text": "declinatur *mercátor' (m)."}, {"y0": 248.1, "x0": 68.0, "x1": 266.0, "text": "*Leo' (m) et :homo' (m) declinantur hóc modo:"}, {"y0": 261.5, "x0": 37.8, "x1": 268.3, "text": "170 Sing. Plür. Sing. Plàr."}, {"y0": 275.3, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 286.2, "text": "Nóm.  ]leó leon|as homo homin|es"}, {"y0": 288.3, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 286.0, "text": "Acc. — leon|em león|és homin|em — homin|és"}, {"y0": 302.9, "x0": 57.7, "x1": 291.2, "text": "Gen.  leon|s  león|um homin|is  homin|um"}, {"y0": 316.2, "x0": 57.4, "x1": 294.8, "text": "Dat.  leon|i  leon[ibus homin|; ^ homin|ibus"}, {"y0": 330.0, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 294.8, "text": "175 Abi. leonle — león|ibus homine ^ homin|ibus"}, {"y0": 345.7, "x0": 68.0, "x1": 251.8, "text": "*Vox' (f) et *pes' (m) déclinantur hoc modo:"}, {"y0": 359.0, "x0": 95.7, "x1": 268.2, "text": "Sing. Plür. Sing. Plür."}, {"y0": 372.5, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 274.3, "text": "Nóm. vx vóc|as pés ped|es"}, {"